  "job_B9.2.5_20251003_114956": {
    "chunk_text": "\u00fe\u00e6re sibbe to \u00fe\u00e6re On hiora \u00f0\u00e6m \u00e6restan gewinne Amilcor, Cartaina cynig, \u00fea he to Romanum mid firde faran wolde, On \u00f0\u00e6m geare Ilirice ofslogon Romana \u00e6rendracan. \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m Fuluius Postumius se consul for \u00fe\u00e6m on hie fird gel\u00e6dde, & fela ofslagen wear\u00f0 on Sona \u00fe\u00e6s on \u00fe\u00e6m \u00e6fterran gere gel\u00e6rdan Romana biscepas swelce niwe r\u00e6das swelce hie fol oft \u00e6r Ac hit God wr\u00e6c on him swa he \u00e6r ealneg dyde, swa oft swa hie mid monnum ofredan, \u00fe\u00e6t hie \u00de\u00e6r w\u00e6s \u00e6rest gesiene on \u00fe\u00e6m gefeohte \u00fee hie wi\u00f0 Gallium h\u00e6fdon: \u00feeh \u00fee heora agnes fultumes \u00de\u00e6t him \u00fea ge\u00feuhte swelc \u00fe\u00e6t m\u00e6ste w\u00e6l swelc hie oft \u00e6r for noht h\u00e6fdon. \u00c6t hiora o\u00feran gefeohte w\u00e6s Gallia IX M ofslagen. \u00de\u00e6s on \u00fe\u00e6m \u00feriddan geare Mallius Tarcuatus & Fuluius Falceus w\u00e6ron consulas om Rome. Hie gefuhton wi\u00f0 Gallium, & hiora III M ofslogon, & VI M gefengon. On \u00fe\u00e6m \u00e6fterran geare w\u00e6ron monege wundor gesewene. An w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6t on Piceno \u00fe\u00e6m wuda an wielle weol blode; & on Tracio \u00fe\u00e6m londe mon geseah & weard swa micel eor\u00febeofung \u00fe\u00e6t on Caria & on Ro\u00feum \u00fe\u00e6m iglondum wurdon micle hryras, \u00dey geare Fiaminius se consul forseah \u00fea s\u00e6gene \u00fee \u00fea hlyttan him s\u00e6don, & him logan, \u00fe",
